/-!
# B5 chunk side, part 10: the native set-up pair `eCn` / `tearP`

`eCn = initP rg; eCcore; finiP rg; distAll oN`: from the descriptor alone on `Zn` to the
chunk-pass register file `kerRegs …` on `oN` (`eCn_sp`).
